{
  "uid": "marin-home",
  "title": "Home",
  "description": "The landing page: what is firing, what the fleet is drawing, what is queued, and whether the CoreWeave control planes and GB200 racks are whole. Everything here is fleet-wide; the linked dashboards add cluster, job and run selectors.",
